* B: JFET op amp with a p-JFET input pair (TL071-like input stage), +/-15 V
.subckt OPA_PJFET inp inn vcc vee out
* tail: pnp current source 200 uA from vcc
Q10 t b10 r10 QP
R10 vcc r10 2k
Q11 b10 b10 r11 QP
R11 vcc r11 2k
Ib  b10 vee 200u
* input pair (inn on J1, inp on J2) with npn mirror load
J1 d1 inn t JP
J2 d2 inp t JP
Q3 d1 d1 vee QN
Q4 d2 d1 vee QN
* second stage: npn common emitter, Miller capacitor, current-source load
Q5 o2 d2 vee QN
Cc d2 o2 15p
Q12 ot b12 r12 QP 5
R12 vcc r12 400
* separate bias for Q12, so that its saturation cannot starve the tail mirror
Ib2 b12 vee 200u
Q13 b12 b12 r13 QP
R13 vcc r13 2k
* class-AB output: bias diodes from ot down to o2
D1 ot m DD
D2 m o2 DD
Q7 vcc ot e7 QN 10
Q8 vee o2 e8 QP 10
R7 e7 out 25
R8 e8 out 25
.ends
